TITLE Calcite kinetics at 200C; track SI(Witherite)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cl 10
    Cu 10
    Ba 5

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
        -tol 1e-10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -si Witherite
END
